description	"Twitch

An unstable and unpredictable duelist from Taris, extremely agile and disruptive.

^2Weaponry:
- Frenzied Melee
-- 50% Faster Swings
-- 60% Lower Damage
- Dual Rodian Blasters (Westar 3)
-- 25% Faster Rof, 
-- 25% Less damage/FP damage
-- 15% Slower Velocity
-- Low Clip Size
- Pocket Dueling Grenades (10)
-- Quickthrow Only
-- Small Radius, 70% Less Damage
-- Slows on det
- Dull Vibrosaber (Purple)
-- Saber Defense 0
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect

^8Attributes:
- Tracking Beacon
- Unpredictable (Sense Immunity)
- 50% Faster Cooldowns
- Dexterity (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- Healing (3)
- 40% More Knockback Taken

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS2]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS4]"
